    },
    {
      "id": "kVEN0eLmVsYreAWogIrLI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1604.9305790690944,
      "y": 1798.9824647923608,
      "width": 783.8194580078125,
      "height": 1775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2008981853,
      "version": 2192,
      "versionNonce": 1961262269,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784447507833,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "signal.notifyCmtex:\n- acts as noticaton to idenof when the thing is shut down\n- defer means to run this function later when current function\nis about to retrun\n\nportAllocator:\n- creates port manager used to give\noyt avaiable network ports and keep track of which ports are \nalreadt being used\n- pot <=> door number for a network service here\n- makes a list of usedPorts map keeps track of which ones\nare currently occupied here\n10000 ❌ already used\n10001 ✅ available\n10002 ✅ available\n10003 ✅ available\n10005 ❌ already used\n10010 ❌ already used\n- for the agent replicas to run\n\nnodeManager:\n- fxn creates and init nodeManager object\n- acts like a k8 like scheduler/orechtor\n- manages a fake cluter of machines (right now)\nto decide on what node to run workfload\n- where k8 cluster/ agentOS cluster in this case\nis simply a group of node clusters here\n- when a new replicas is to be run ?\n- ask questions where should this agent run \n- (maybe add docker conatiners)\n- and abilty to make nodes here\n- right now it just uses the smiluated metadata\n- can puginto use docker later on or k8 for this\n(golang SSDK for it)\n- refer to k8usage inside the agent workflow there\n\nSecrets Manager:\n- memory key-value store for secrets\n- for diff levels of scope\n(global for all agents  or weathe-agent for specf agents)\n\nnew state store:\n- creates and initalis a state storage manger for agents\n- where they store the state so that they can be statless\n(just like docker coatiners or k8)\n- - place where agent can save and reteuve its own data.stire\n(new )\n- postgres and redis\n\nInit Observabiity Manager:\n- init observaility metrics tracker\n\nnewObsManger\n- stoes telemert data about agent executions\n- logs (what happended), matrics (how much/how often/how fast)\n- traces (hwere did time go across services)\n- in memory list \n\ninit agent registry with sumlated markeplace:\n- keeps track of agent that are registed/running in your system\n- markeplace: acts like an apps tire conating read made agent templctes thatthe\nuser can install\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "signal.notifyCmtex:\n- acts as noticaton to idenof when the thing is shut down\n- defer means to run this function later when current function\nis about to retrun\n\nportAllocator:\n- creates port manager used to give\noyt avaiable network ports and keep track of which ports are \nalreadt being used\n- pot <=> door number for a network service here\n- makes a list of usedPorts map keeps track of which ones\nare currently occupied here\n10000 ❌ already used\n10001 ✅ available\n10002 ✅ available\n10003 ✅ available\n10005 ❌ already used\n10010 ❌ already used\n- for the agent replicas to run\n\nnodeManager:\n- fxn creates and init nodeManager object\n- acts like a k8 like scheduler/orechtor\n- manages a fake cluter of machines (right now)\nto decide on what node to run workfload\n- where k8 cluster/ agentOS cluster in this case\nis simply a group of node clusters here\n- when a new replicas is to be run ?\n- ask questions where should this agent run \n- (maybe add docker conatiners)\n- and abilty to make nodes here\n- right now it just uses the smiluated metadata\n- can puginto use docker later on or k8 for this\n(golang SSDK for it)\n- refer to k8usage inside the agent workflow there\n\nSecrets Manager:\n- memory key-value store for secrets\n- for diff levels of scope\n(global for all agents  or weathe-agent for specf agents)\n\nnew state store:\n- creates and initalis a state storage manger for agents\n- where they store the state so that they can be statless\n(just like docker coatiners or k8)\n- - place where agent can save and reteuve its own data.stire\n(new )\n- postgres and redis\n\nInit Observabiity Manager:\n- init observaility metrics tracker\n\nnewObsManger\n- stoes telemert data about agent executions\n- logs (what happended), matrics (how much/how often/how fast)\n- traces (hwere did time go across services)\n- in memory list \n\ninit agent registry with sumlated markeplace:\n- keeps track of agent that are registed/running in your system\n- markeplace: acts like an apps tire conating read made agent templctes thatthe\nuser can install\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
