      "updated": 1784575510300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI optimiser:\n- this is where real value lies\n- every few hours\n- pause losers\n- increase winners\n- duplicate winners\n- refresh fatigue\n- change headlines\n- swap hooks\n- generate new creatives\n- expand audience\n- raise bids\n- essentialsy\nautomate the work a performance\nmarketer would normally do every day",
